      "Prestige tiers are subjective best-judgment estimates based on historical NCAA D2 tournament/Elite Eight/Final Four/championship success as of ~2025; many mid/lower-tier schools default to tier 2 absent specific knowledge and should be treated as rough estimates, not verified rankings",
      "Some programs may have closed, merged, or changed division status very recently (e.g. Notre Dame College OH closed 2024, Concordia NY closed 2023, Alderson Broaddus WV closed 2023) and are deliberately excluded"
    ]
